&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/UK Remote | 💰£108,700 - £130,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Audit Transformation Lead to help reinvent Internal Audit at Monzo.&amp;nbsp; You’ll have the freedom to redefine how assurance is delivered at scale, by being at the heart of Internal Audit’s transformation agenda.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need an audit background for this role.&amp;nbsp; What we’re looking for is a natural collaborator, who can bridge different stakeholder groups to turn ambitious ideas into reality.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ Our Internal Audit team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Internal Audit is Monzo’s Third Line of Defence, and we’re here to help Monzo grow safely.&amp;nbsp; We’re looking for a passionate Senior Audit Transformation Lead, to help us create an outsized impact for the Internal Audit function.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional role that gives you a holistic and global view of Monzo. You’ll be an individual contributor who sits at the intersection of assurance, data and product design to drive transformation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited by the prospect of embracing technology and product design principles to redefine what assurance looks like, then we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating Internal Audit’s strategy into a concrete product roadmap with measurable business and risk outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing a product owner mindset across the Internal Audit function, that is focused on providing technology enabled, repeatable and value-driven assurance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with the Senior Audit Innovation and Enablement Lead, Head of Professional Practices and the audit team to identify opportunities for innovation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernising the Internal Audit function by embedding technology into what we do, and how we do things.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching the Internal Audit function to adopt new technologies and ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building collaborative working relationships with stakeholders outside of Internal Audit, such as Risk and Compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving communications and engagement across Monzo, to maximise the value of Internal Audit products and insights.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing and shaping cross-Collective initiatives that have an impact on the Internal Audit function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positioning Monzo as a leading benchmark for technology led assurance, by building strategic partnerships with regulatory bodies, industry forums and academia. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are energised by the idea of translating abstract frameworks and design principles, into concrete outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can influence senior stakeholders and technical leads without direct line management authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can communicate data or engineering concepts to non-technical audiences, and also translate business requirements into technical specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think like a product owner, and have a track record of leading agile, digital or operational transformations in a fast moving environment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can manage product roadmaps and drive end-user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in fast-moving environments with developing risk and control frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £108,700 - £130,000 ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup. ➕ Plus lots more!&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
