&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on our Happiness Delivery team, you’ll help shape the future of On’s customer experience. Working at the core of our Operations technologies team cluster. You’ll develop services and intelligent solutions that make every customer interaction smoother and more effective, improve satisfaction and drive long-term loyalty. You’ll build solutions that leverage AI and automation to deliver personalised support experiences and improve the efficiency of our support teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain robust and scalable backend services using our modern tech stack, with a primary focus on &lt;strong&gt;NestJS, TypeScript, &lt;/strong&gt;and&lt;strong&gt; GraphQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain full-stack solutions for our Happiness Delivery agents to efficiently assist our customers whether on a phone call, chat or an email case using &lt;strong&gt;NestJS/TypeScript/Vue.js&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with software engineers, product managers, and other stakeholders to deliver end-to-end features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, maintainable, and well-tested code, and contribute to a culture of high quality and continuous improvement through code reviews and pair programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and operate your services in a cloud-native environment on Google Cloud Platform (GCP), using Kubernetes and Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with and contribute to our distributed systems landscape, helping to build resilient systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Story&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong background in backend development, with proven experience building and shipping high-quality software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;NestJs/Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;, with a deep understanding of modern backend frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience in designing, building, and consuming &lt;strong&gt;GraphQL/RESTFul APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of relational databases (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;) and data modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (&lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus) and containerization technologies (&lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;frontend development&lt;/strong&gt; and experience with &lt;strong&gt;modern web technologies&lt;/strong&gt; to build seamless user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a collaborative team player with excellent communication skills, comfortable working in an agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus points for experience with:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event-driven systems (e.g., Kafka, BullMQ, Pub/Sub)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with customer support tools such as Salesforce, Talkdesk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a team of software engineers from diverse technical backgrounds, we are united by a single mission: to create the most premium customer support experience in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we focus on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the Complete Experience: We develop and support both our customer-facing applications and the internal tools that empower our Happiness Delivery agents to provide world-class support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving Innovation and Automation: We leverage a modern tech stack (NestJS, TypeScript, GCP) to innovate with automation, AI, building proactive and intelligent solutions that anticipate customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering a Connected Ecosystem: We are responsible for the full lifecycle of our software, from designing robust integrations with critical systems like Salesforce and Talkdesk to ensuring our platforms are reliable, scalable, and performant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Ingenuity is a fully integrated digital commerce ecosystem, designed to power brands without limits. Our global end-to-end tech platform is comprised of three products: THG Commerce, THG Studios, THG Fulfilment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each represents a single, unified solution, overcoming challenges and taking brands direct-to-consumer. Our client portfolio includes globally recognised brands such as Coca-Cola, Nestle, Elemis, Homebase, and Proctor &amp;amp; Gamble.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;260&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;260&quot;&gt;Position: Senior Customer Success Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;262&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;THG Ingenuity Commerce plays a key role in delivering world-class ecommerce solutions for globally recognised brands. As part of a fast-paced, high-growth environment, you&#39;ll own strategic customer relationships, driving long-term success, retention, and commercial growth across a portfolio of globally recognised customers. This is an opportunity to partner with senior stakeholders, influence customer strategy, and mentor the wider Customer Success team while delivering measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-section-id=&quot;14uqk01&quot; data-start=&quot;755&quot; data-end=&quot;780&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;1112&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;Customer Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own a portfolio of Tier 2 customer relationships from onboarding through renewal, building trusted partnerships with key stakeholders. Lead strategic account planning and Executive Business Reviews to ensure customers achieve their business objectives and maximise value from the partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1114&quot; data-end=&quot;1406&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1114&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;Customer Success &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a deep understanding of each customer&#39;s business, proactively driving adoption, retention, and expansion opportunities. Lead renewal negotiations and identify opportunities to grow Annual Contract Value (ACV) while supporting long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1408&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1408&quot; data-end=&quot;1436&quot;&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor customer health, commercial performance, and service delivery against agreed KPIs. Provide insight-led reporting and forecasting, ensuring CRM accuracy and clear visibility of customer performance, risks, and opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1902&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Commercial Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of renewal performance, revenue recognition, and commercial outcomes across your portfolio. Manage forecasting, mitigate commercial risks, and ensure delivery against ACV and revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1904&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1904&quot; data-end=&quot;1937&quot;&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Escalation Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and manage commercial, operational, and delivery risks. Lead complex customer escalations, working cross-functionally to deliver timely resolutions while maintaining strong customer confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2154&quot; data-end=&quot;2355&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2154&quot; data-end=&quot;2189&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Sales, Delivery, Product, Finance, and Technical teams to ensure seamless customer experiences and successful delivery of strategic initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2382&quot;&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of Customer Success Managers through mentoring, knowledge sharing, and best practice guidance, helping to drive consistency and excellence across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-section-id=&quot;1j0fx74&quot; data-start=&quot;2564&quot; data-end=&quot;2581&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2583&quot; data-end=&quot;3280&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ciana&quot; data-start=&quot;2583&quot; data-end=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;Proven experience in Customer Success, Account Management, or Client Services within ecommerce, SaaS, technology, or digital environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15r49bs&quot; data-start=&quot;2724&quot; data-end=&quot;2825&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing strategic customer relationships, renewals, and commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q79je6&quot; data-start=&quot;2826&quot; data-end=&quot;2954&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills with the confidence to lead Executive Business Reviews and senior customer conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b2kx7v&quot; data-start=&quot;2955&quot; data-end=&quot;3047&quot;&gt;Commercially minded, with experience delivering retention, expansion, and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mxxxc1&quot; data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3168&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and organisational skills, with experience using CRM platforms and forecasting customer performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15aapl&quot; data-start=&quot;3169&quot; data-end=&quot;3228&quot;&gt;Experience coaching or mentoring colleagues is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hmwzlf&quot; data-start=&quot;3229&quot; data-end=&quot;3280&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proficient in PowerPoint, Excel, and CRM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG Ingenuity please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Ingenuity is a fully integrated digital commerce ecosystem, designed to power brands without limits. Our global end-to-end tech platform is comprised of three products: THG Commerce, THG Studios, THG Fulfilment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each represents a single, unified solution, overcoming challenges and taking brands direct-to-consumer. Our client portfolio includes globally recognised brands such as Coca-Cola, Nestle, Elemis, Homebase, and Proctor &amp;amp; Gamble.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;THG Ingenuity is the technology and commerce division of THG, built to power the world&#39;s most ambitious brands. Our proprietary end-to-end platform brings together technology, data, digital marketing, fulfilment, and creative services - giving brands everything they need to grow globally, without limits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We work with leading global names including Nestlé, Procter &amp;amp; Gamble, and Walgreens Boots Alliance, alongside THG&#39;s own market-leading brands such as Myprotein and Lookfantastic. With a team of people worldwide, we move fast, hold ourselves to a high standard, and give people real ownership from day one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Content Executive is a hands-on role within THG Ingenuity&#39;s Content team, responsible for writing, editing, and publishing high-quality content across client brand websites and digital channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role covers content for a wide range of clients across sectors including Beauty, Healthcare, and Technology, with a significant proportion of clients operating in Beauty. You&#39;ll interpret content briefs and produce accurate, on-brand copy that reflects each client&#39;s tone of voice, style guide, and publishing standards, while applying SEO and EEAT best practice to support organic performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work within client CMS platforms to manage the full content lifecycle - from drafting and proofreading through to publishing - and will build strong working relationships with internal teams and external stakeholders. Given the number of clients operating in regulated industries, an understanding of compliance requirements is an important part of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Content Writing &amp;amp; Editing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Write and edit content in line with brand guidelines, tone of voice, and client style guides.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Interpret content briefs and translate requirements into effective, accurate, and engaging content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proofread all content thoroughly, with strong attention to spelling, grammar, and accuracy before publishing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Follow established formatting standards and publishing processes to ensure consistency across client sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SEO &amp;amp; Content Performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Apply EEAT and SEO principles - including keyword optimisation, meta data, and internal linking - to support content visibility and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use SEO tools such as SEMrush, Ahrefs, Google Search Console, and Google Analytics to inform content decisions and monitor results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyse and communicate content performance through reporting, identifying opportunities for optimisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay aware of AI-related industry trends - including AI search, AI overviews, and GEO - and their impact on content strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;CMS &amp;amp; Publishing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage content within CMS platforms, ensuring accurate set-up, formatting, and publishing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Apply understanding of HTML and web publishing best practice to ensure content displays correctly across devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use supporting systems to manage content operations and requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use AI tools responsibly to support content creation and productivity, in line with brand and quality standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Workload Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build and manage relationships with internal and external stakeholders, understanding and delivering against their content requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Prioritise workload and manage multiple deadlines, adapting to changes in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with SEO, brand, and account teams to ensure content is delivered accurately and on time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain a strong commitment to content quality and accuracy across all work produced.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Apply an understanding of compliance requirements when producing content for clients in regulated industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
